    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Clicker</strong> is an exciting casual game in which you have to defeat opponents with mouse clicks, but be careful because not all opponents should be defeated because they steal lives or points from you. The game also gets faster the further you get and new types of enemies appear A round ends when you have no more health points, the goal of the game is to beat your high score.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game idea.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ different enemies and events!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different difficulty levels.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable user interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting music</p></li></ul>",
